<h1>Visiting the workshop</h1>

<p class="lead">
  Bringing your bike to Wheelhouse is simple.
</p>

<div class="row g-4 mt-2">
  <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
    <section>
      <h2>Where to find us</h2>

      <p>
        Wheelhouse Bicycle Workshop<br>
        42 Market Street<br>
        Santiago
      </p>

      <h2>Opening hours</h2>

      <ul class="list-group">
        <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between">
          <span>Monday – Friday</span>
          <span>9:00 – 18:00</span>
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between">
          <span>Saturday</span>
          <span>10:00 – 14:00</span>
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between">
          <span>Sunday</span>
          <span>Closed</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
    <section>
      <h2>What happens when you arrive?</h2>

      <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered">
        <li class="list-group-item">
          Bring your bike to the counter.
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item">
          We inspect the bike and record the work it may need.
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item">
          If necessary, we diagnose the problem and contact you with a quote.
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item">
          We only begin quoted work after you approve it.
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item">
          When the repair is finished, your bike is ready for collection.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>